    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 UX-01: some commands take repo path positionally (`hypergumbo sketch /path`), others via `--path` (`hypergumbo routes --path /path`), `catalog` accepts neither (CWD only). Causes errors when users carry syntax between commands. Standardize: accept both positional and `--path` on every subcommand; if both given, error."  # 6947
