- op: discuss  # ba3c
  at: '2026-04-15T11:53:03Z'  # ba3c
  by: agent  # ba3c
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ba3c
  clock: 3  # ba3c
  nonce: ba3c  # ba3c
  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. New _add_path_argument() helper registers both positional 'path' (nargs='?') and --path (dest='_path_flag') on a subparser. main() post-process resolves both into args.path, errors with exit 2 if both explicitly set. Applied to 11 subcommands: sketch, run, slice, search, routes, explain, test-coverage, dead-code-maybe, symbols, io-boundaries, verify-claims. Command functions need no changes since args.path remains the resolved destination. 9 new tests cover all subcommand convention permutations + both-forms-error case."  # ba3c
